Description: OPNsense integration tools for linuxmuster.net 7.3
 Command-line tools and hooks that connect a linuxmuster.net 7.3 server to
 an OPNsense firewall through its REST API:
  * opn-update-aliases syncs roles, rooms and hardware groups from the
    linuxmuster device inventory to OPNsense firewall aliases; a
    device-import hook runs it for every configured school.
  * opn-captive-voucher creates, lists and deletes captive portal vouchers.
  * opn-captive-sessions lists and disconnects captive portal sessions; a
    group-manager hook ends the WLAN sessions of users removed from the
    wifi group.
 .
 Each school is configured in /etc/linuxmuster/opnsense/<school>.ini, so
 several schools can share one firewall.
